# Pruned mirror of remotion/public used only for bundling (8.4 GB of copies).
# Remotion copies the whole public dir into every bundle; the full 262 GB dir filled the disk,
# so builds point at this subset instead. It is a derived artifact, never a source.
remotion/public_min/

# QC contact sheets and sampled frames: regenerable, thousands of files (2026-08-22)
runs/qc/pool_frames/
